<title>GERMANY: German Jan/Sept 1996 coffee imports detailed.</title>
<headline>German Jan/Sept 1996 coffee imports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the EU totalled 8.78 million bags in January-September 1996 compared with 8.63 million bags in the same period a year earlier, the DKV coffee association said.</p>
<p>Imports of 1.05 million bags in September 1996 were up from 969,222 in September 1995 and up from 1.04 bags in August 1996.</p>
<p>Colombia shipped 182,175 bags in September after 198,226 bags in August, Brazil 119,833 (54,333), El Salvador 103,935 (160,553), Papua New Guinea 101,214 (62,599) and Indonesia 86,153 (72,218).</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom +49-40-41903275</p>
